// Bandit Level 0 → Level 1

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Open the Bandit challenge and connect to the Bandit server using SSH:

        ssh bandit0@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password:

        bandit0

Step3: After logging in, list the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: A file named `readme` is present.

Step5: Read the contents of the file using:

        cat readme

Step6: The output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit1`.

Step7: Use the displayed password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit1@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step8: The Bandit Level 0 → Level 1 challenge is solved.

Step9: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
